sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Student as Authenticated Student
    participant UI as Student Portal UI (JSP + JS)
    participant Sec as Auth & CSRF Filters
    participant ResServlet as ResourceServlet
    participant BookServlet as BookmarkServlet
    participant ResSvc as ResourceService
    participant PersSvc as PersonalizationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16
    participant Storage as File Storage Disk

    Note over Student, Storage: Browsing Academic Hierarchy & Materials
    Student->>UI: Selects Course & Semester (e.g., Computer Science / Sem 3)
    UI->>Sec: GET /student/resources?courseId=1&semesterId=3
    Sec->>ResServlet: Forward Request
    ResServlet->>ResSvc: getResourcesByCourseAndSemester(1, 3)
    ResSvc->>DB: Query resources, subjects, categories
    DB-->>ResSvc: Filtered Resource List
    ResSvc-->>ResServlet: List<ResourceSummaryDto>
    ResServlet-->>UI: Render resources.jsp with Material Cards

    Note over Student, Storage: Viewing Embedded Educational Resource
    Student->>UI: Clicks "View Resource" (PDF / Image)
    UI->>Sec: GET /student/resources/view?id=42
    Sec->>ResServlet: Forward Request
    ResServlet->>ResSvc: getResourceDetails(42)
    ResSvc->>DB: Fetch Resource & Increment View Count
    ResServlet->>PersSvc: recordRecentView(studentId, 42)
    PersSvc->>DB: UPSERT user_recent_views
    ResServlet-->>UI: Render view-resource.jsp with embedded viewer iframe

    UI->>ResServlet: GET /student/resources/stream?id=42 (Inline stream)
    ResServlet->>ResSvc: getFileStream(42)
    ResSvc->>Storage: Read file from C:/StudyMate/storage/uploads/...
    Storage-->>ResSvc: InputStream
    ResServlet-->>UI: Stream bytes with Content-Type: application/pdf

    Note over Student, Storage: Bookmarking Learning Asset
    Student->>UI: Clicks Bookmark Toggle Icon
    UI->>Sec: POST /student/bookmarks/toggle (JSON payload, X-CSRF-Token header)
    Sec->>BookServlet: Forward Request
    BookServlet->>PersSvc: toggleBookmark(studentId, 42)
    PersSvc->>DB: Check & Toggle user_bookmarks
    DB-->>PersSvc: Bookmark Added / Removed Status
    PersSvc-->>BookServlet: Updated Bookmark State
    BookServlet-->>UI: JSON Response { success: true, bookmarked: true }
    UI-->>Student: Update UI bookmark indicator smoothly

